            "comprehends": [
             "copies/wn516xn5163#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Pencil, five digits run together, no separators; grouped 29|6|22. The month figure is a single stroke closing into a bottom bowl, so a 6 rather than the two-stroke 8 of this hand, but it is the one arguable figure"
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
